	That was a (guess what) WAND OF UNDEAD TURNING!!

	As you guessed, it was the same black dragon, that you were killing 
and "undeading" all the time.

	I haven't found much use for it except for undeading corpses before
sacrificing at altars, so as to have fresh corpses.

	Ofcourse, if you always take your pets along with you, you could
undead your pet, everytime it died. I usually abandon my pet on the first 
level itself.



